# The interactive prompt history (core/input_handler.py).  It records what the
# user typed at the permission gate, so a pasted credential lands in it — it is
# runtime state, not source, and it must never be committed.
data/cli_history
# Google OAuth refresh tokens for the Gmail/Calendar/Drive plugins.  A refresh
# token is a long-lived credential for the user's whole mailbox — it must never
# end up in a commit.
data/google_tokens*
